+
+#### [Surya](https://github.com/datalab-to/surya)
+> **Description:** Surya is a document OCR toolkit covering OCR, layout analysis, reading order, table recognition, and LaTeX OCR across 90-plus languages. The README makes clear that it is intended for serious document understanding rather than simple plain-text extraction. That makes it highly relevant for multilingual legal teams handling mixed-format exhibits, invoices, tables, and scanned records. Surya is especially useful when the legal workflow depends on page layout, reading order, or tables surviving extraction. Verified from GitHub: updated `2026-01-08`, about `19.4k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `GPL-3.0`.
+
