+#### [Phileas](https://github.com/philterd/phileas)
+> **Description:** Phileas is an open source Java engine for de-identifying and redacting PII, PHI, and other sensitive information from text and PDF documents. The README emphasizes configurable policies, multiple redaction strategies, date shifting, consistent replacements, conditional filtering, and support for dozens of identifier types. It also calls out legal-domain support through the broader Philter ecosystem, which makes it more directly relevant to lawyers than many generic anonymization tools. For firms that need policy-heavy redaction rather than just regex cleanup, Phileas is worth attention. Verified from GitHub: updated `2025-11-14`, about `73` stars, primary language `Java`, license `Apache-2.0`.
