+### Transcription And Deposition Workflow
+
+#### [Whisper](https://github.com/openai/whisper)
+> **Description:** Whisper is the standard open source baseline for modern speech transcription. The README describes it as a general-purpose speech recognition model trained on diverse audio for multilingual transcription, speech translation, and language identification. For legal use, that means depositions, witness interviews, intake calls, and recorded meetings can be transcribed locally or inside a controlled environment instead of being sent to a proprietary SaaS transcription vendor. Whisper is model-centric rather than workflow-centric, but it remains the foundation of many open transcription stacks. Verified from GitHub: active public repo, about `92.1k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `MIT`.
