+
+> Best AI tools for lawyers in 2026 are increasingly open source, self-hosted, and GitHub-first. This curated awesome list focuses only on public GitHub repositories that help lawyers, legal ops teams, and researchers with contract analysis, OCR, redaction, transcription, legal search, local LLM workflows, and document-heavy knowledge work.
