+### Privacy, Redaction, And De-Identification
+
+#### [Presidio](https://github.com/microsoft/presidio)
+> **Description:** Presidio is one of the most mature open source frameworks for finding and anonymizing sensitive information in text, images, and structured data. The README emphasizes detection, redaction, masking, and anonymization pipelines backed by NLP, recognizers, and custom policies. That is directly relevant to privileged legal workflows, where lawyers need to review, redact, or de-identify client names, account numbers, health information, and other sensitive fields before sharing datasets or filings. Presidio is not legal-specific, but it is arguably the strongest general-purpose open source privacy layer for legal AI systems. Verified from GitHub: visible release `2025-09-09`, about `6.5k` stars, primary language `Python`, license `MIT`.
