+#### [Haystack](https://github.com/deepset-ai/haystack)
+> **Description:** Haystack is an orchestration framework for production-ready LLM applications. The README emphasizes pipelines, agents, retrieval, document processing, file conversion, vector database integration, and flexible model backends. For legal teams, that matters because many “AI for lawyers” systems are really carefully assembled RAG applications over contracts, policies, and precedent. Haystack gives strong control over those moving parts without locking the team into one hosted stack. It is a framework rather than a finished legal product, but it is a serious GitHub foundation for custom legal assistants. Verified from GitHub: updated `2026-01-09`, about `23.8k` stars, primary language `MDX`, license `Apache-2.0`.
